{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的纵向交替排法不如X的左右分栏容易快速扫视，尤其S03、S11等停留较短的段落，感受信息与话语交替较密，容易打断阅读节奏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏确实更容易一眼扫过，叙事和感受也有清楚的区域区分，但右侧短词较多是并列堆放，观众不容易判断它们分别对应人物心理的哪个转折。Y通过重点词加亮、话语与感受交替，以及感受在对应乐段才出现，让人物为什么动摇、为什么怀念、为什么不愿回头更加清楚，尤其把想念、委屈、孤独、希望和重新站稳之间的细微变化呈现出来。虽然Y更费眼睛，但它在音乐进程、人物心理和具体感受之间建立了更紧密的联系，整体观看体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b310bf76-76ef-4ac7-b7e7-62f52b6e83e5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T063011421797Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:30:43.904524+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7823d3886df891152cee3c025805021da0416c866c34b4bb90464ceb0cb717c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb